# FIRST Global Simulator

Design, build, and explore a 2026 **Igniting Innovation** robot with Team Vietnam's community simulator.

> The simulator is actively evolving. Account access, saved robot builds, match creation, and the offline sandbox are available today. Browser-based lobby joining and live multiplayer gameplay are still in development.

## What you can do

- Request access or register with an invitation code.
- Configure and save a robot build in the [Robot Builder](/docs/robot-builder).
- Create a FGC 2026 lobby from the dashboard.
- Explore the field through the offline sandbox.

## Choose your path

### New to the simulator

Start with [Getting started](/docs/getting-started) to learn how access, sign-in, and the dashboard work.

### Ready to build

Open the [Robot Builder](/docs/robot-builder) to configure your drivetrain, intake, and scoring mechanism.

### Want to simulate

Read the [Simulator guide](/docs/simulator) for lobby creation, sandbox entry, and the current multiplayer status.

If you run into trouble, see the [FAQ](/docs/faq) or contact Team Vietnam at [vietnamteamfgc@gmail.com](mailto:vietnamteamfgc@gmail.com).
